      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Translation Provider**\n\nI've decided to move forward with the Google Cloud Translation API for this project. My next step will be to write the initial imports and instantiate the client within the `batch_translate.py` file to get the process started.\n\n\n**Implementing Batch Translation**\n\nI'm now focusing on implementing the batch translation function within `batch_translate.py`. My plan is to use the Google Cloud Translation client to translate a list of strings while preserving their original order. I'll need to define the function parameters for the input strings, target language, and an optional source language. Next, I'll integrate the `google.cloud.translate_v3` client to perform the batch translation.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789819778900,
          "start": 1789819776849
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b9926f51001D4yA2qEE67qKvY",
